<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Lantau Peak - (built 1978) 115,759 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $6.25 million.</p>
<p>Cumberland Sky - (built 1969) 19,356 dwt sold to Singaporean buyers for $1.2 million.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Cabo San Vicente - (built 1981) 64,896 dwt sold within Chile for $14.6 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
